 "name_en": "Managing Material Price Changes and Inventory Values (1ZT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Managing Material Price Changes and Inventory Values (1ZT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides users with an example of a process description that they can use to change material prices, mark prices for change, and release prices for material valuation.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can make a price change in two ways:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In a single processing step with immediate effect: When material costs are changed, inventory is revaluated with all price controls, including valuation with standard price and valuation with periodic unit price.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Change in a two-step procedure via determine Future Prices and Releasing Planned Prices: (1) When future prices are entered, the new future valuation prices are updated in all currencies and valuations in the material ledger data and in the company code currency in the material master record.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">(2) When planned price changes are released, the system updates the valid future prices (in the various currencies and valuations) as the current standard price or valuation price, and calculates a revaluation amount for the specific inventory quantity and revaluates the inventory value by this amount. The offsetting entry takes place in the revaluation account in accordance with account determination. If no material stock exists, only the price is changed.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Choose between two alternatives: 1) A one-step price change where you change material costs and upload the material inventory prices; 2) a two-step procedure where you enter the future price and release the planned price change</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View the material inventory values with a balance summary report</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain valuation prices independently in up to three currencies or valuations (cloud only)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support group and local currencies in predelivered content</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>管理物料价格更改和库存价值 (1ZT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目为用户提供流程描述示例，可用于更改物料价格、标记价格更改以及发布价格以进行物料评估。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以通过两种方式进行价格更改：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在立即生效的单个处理步骤中：更改物料成本时，将使用所有价格控制重估库存，包括使用标准价格的评估和使用定期单位价格的评估。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过确定未来价格和发布计划价格在两步式程序中进行更改：(1) 输入未来价格时，新的未来评估价格将以物料分类账数据中的所有货币和评估以及物料主记录中的公司代码货币进行更新。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">(2) 发布计划价格更改时，系统会更新有效的未来价格（以各种货币和评估）作为当前标准价格或评估价格，并计算特定库存数量的重估金额，并按此金额重估库存价值。抵销分录根据科目确定在重估科目中进行。如果不存在物料库存，则仅更改价格。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在两个备选项之间进行选择：1) 一步式价格更改，您可以在其中更改物料成本并上传物料库存价格；2) 两步式程序，您可以在其中输入未来价格并发布计划价格更改</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用余额汇总报表查看物料库存价值。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod297e2e32ead4a35a56de011164914f5__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">以最多三种货币或评估独立维护评估价格（仅限云）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在预先提供的内容中支持集团货币和本币</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
